/target
**/*.rs.bk
testdata/**
!testdata/.gitkeep
.DS_Store
!testdata/README.md
# The Sinclair ROMs are the one corpus that may be redistributed — Amstrad has explicitly
# permitted shipping them with emulators. Game images may not, and are covered by the
# blanket rule above. The directory has to be un-ignored before a file inside it can be.
!testdata/roms/
!testdata/roms/*.rom
/.agent-workspace/
